  "license": "FDIC BankFind data are public information compiled by a U.S. federal agency (works of the U.S. government are not subject to copyright, 17 U.S.C. 105); the API is open with no key or account. No separate FDIC license text was found in the API docs; cite the FDIC as the source.",
  "tier": 2,
  "units": "$ thousands (integers as published), original units, no transform",
  "generation": "213771 bank-quarter rows in 40 quarterly files; 680 rows dropped for missing items (insured U.S. branches of foreign banks, which report no equity). Each sample pairs a bank's quarter t with its quarter t+1 (inner join on CERT of consecutive quarter-ends), giving 206527 pairs; subsampled uniformly to 50000 with seed 0. Split key = target quarter-end t+1 (YYYYMMDD). Banks that merge or fail drop out; balance sheets after a merger are used as reported. EQTOT includes noncontrolling interests (EQTOT = EQ + EQCONSUB holds exactly in the data). Values are never altered and no sample is removed on its residual. Full-panel check: LIABEQ = LIAB + EQTOT in every row; ASSET - LIABEQ = +-1 in 3.5% of 2015Q2-2021Q1 rows (rounding); asset-component sum exact except 10 bank-quarters (8 off by 1-3, CERT 23992 off by 520 / 501 in 2019Q4 / 2020Q1, not in the subsample); liability sum exact except 2 rows off by 1.",
  "x_desc": "quarter-t balance sheet: ASSET total assets; CHBAL cash and balances due from depository institutions; FREPO federal funds sold and reverse repurchase agreements; SC total securities; TRADE trading account assets; LNLSNET loans and leases, net of allowance; BKPREM premises and fixed assets; ORE other real estate owned; INTAN intangible assets; AOA all other assets; LIAB total liabilities; DEP total deposits; FREPP federal funds purchased and repurchase agreements; TRADEL trading liabilities; OTHBRF other borrowed money; SUBND subordinated notes and debentures; ALLOTHL all other liabilities; EQTOT total equity capital incl. noncontrolling interests (18)",
  "y_desc": "the same 18 items at quarter t+1 (9 asset components + total assets, 6 liability components + total liabilities, total equity)"
 },
